(7251946, 1126923, 100831, '<td valign="top">Sneak your way to the top, I imagine. Great shot! Love it.</td>', 'Sneak your way to the top, I imagine. Great shot! Love it.', '2014-08-16 12:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7251947, 1127119, 100831, '<td valign="top">Love the blurred motion.Great shot.</td>', 'Love the blurred motion.Great shot.', '2014-08-16 12:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252040, 1127155, 27421, '<td valign="top">Best vanishing point of challenge.</td>', 'Best vanishing point of challenge.', '2014-08-16 18:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252041, 1127133, 27421, '<td valign="top">Most interesting vanishing point of challenge.</td>', 'Most interesting vanishing point of challenge.', '2014-08-16 18:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252222, 1127119, 152252, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image. I love that "ghost" couple. Great composition, detail, and atmosphere. It looks very nice in B&amp;W. Love it. A 10 from me.</td>', 'Very interesting image. I love that "ghost" couple. Great composition, detail, and atmosphere. It looks very nice in B&W. Love it. A 10 from me.', '2014-08-17 21:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252306, 1126906, 173844, '<td valign="top">What I love here are the delicate forest colors, the intricate detail and the filigree interlacing of the tree branches.  The quality of mood is somehow --  whether by wonderful location or technical artistry -- removed a bit from realistic to enchanted.  It certainly is beautiful.  Though, like many entries, this is more a matter of convergence and implied vanishing point rather than actual vanishing point, it''s my favorite of the challenge because of its aforementioned beauty and mystery.  The more I look at it the more I enjoy it.</td>', 'What I love here are the delicate forest colors, the intricate detail and the filigree interlacing of the tree branches.  The quality of mood is somehow --  whether by wonderful location or technical artistry -- removed a bit from realistic to enchanted.  It certainly is beautiful.  Though, like many entries, this is more a matter of convergence and implied vanishing point rather than actual vanishing point, it''s my favorite of the challenge because of its aforementioned beauty and mystery.  The more I look at it the more I enjoy it.', '2014-08-18 00:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252327, 1127033, 173844, '<td valign="top">The long, gradually narrowing path in this excellent black and white ever so patiently unwinds until it crosses a gap in the mountain.  It''s a paean to the simple vastness of the West.  As if this isn''t enough, there are glorious storm clouds overhead, and a storm indifferently raging off to the right.  It speaks to me and is going into my favorites</td>', 'The long, gradually narrowing path in this excellent black and white ever so patiently unwinds until it crosses a gap in the mountain.  It''s a paean to the simple vastness of the West.  As if this isn''t enough, there are glorious storm clouds overhead, and a storm indifferently raging off to the right.  It speaks to me and is going into my favorites', '2014-08-18 01:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252392, 1126893, 63812, '<td valign="top">wow! very nice!</td>', 'wow! very nice!', '2014-08-18 02:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252401, 1127119, 63812, '<td valign="top">Lovely image!</td>', 'Lovely image!', '2014-08-18 02:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252403, 1127155, 63812, '<td valign="top">excellent!</td>', 'excellent!', '2014-08-18 02:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252594, 1126905, 149964, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture and love the light on the clouds. Not sure I can relate it to Vanishing Point....</td>', 'Beautiful picture and love the light on the clouds. Not sure I can relate it to Vanishing Point....', '2014-08-18 15:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252595, 1126810, 149964, '<td valign="top">Whilst I like this as a landscape, I didn''t think it highlighted the Vanishing Point strongly enough.</td>', 'Whilst I like this as a landscape, I didn''t think it highlighted the Vanishing Point strongly enough.', '2014-08-18 15:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252597, 1127190, 149964, '<td valign="top">Really like this - moody! IN fact - just upped it a mark whilst trying to find suitable comment :-)</td>', 'Really like this - moody! IN fact - just upped it a mark whilst trying to find suitable comment :-)', '2014-08-18 15:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252598, 1127198, 149964, '<td valign="top">Really lovely blue hues on this.</td>', 'Really lovely blue hues on this.', '2014-08-18 15:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252601, 1127196, 149964, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this, the more I''m drawn into the VP itself - love it!</td>', 'The more I look at this, the more I''m drawn into the VP itself - love it!', '2014-08-18 15:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252603, 1127155, 149964, '<td valign="top">I like this as a B&amp;W picture and t<br/>he clouds offer a great contrast to the sharp lines of the bridge.</td>', 'I like this as a B&W picture and the clouds offer a great contrast to the sharp lines of the bridge.', '2014-08-18 15:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252604, 1126906, 149964, '<td valign="top">Half expect a mystical woodland character to pop up out of this. The colours and softness are really lovely.</td>', 'Half expect a mystical woodland character to pop up out of this. The colours and softness are really lovely.', '2014-08-18 15:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252605, 1126864, 149964, '<td valign="top">Love the ''life'' in this! And all the contrasting lines.</td>', 'Love the ''life'' in this! And all the contrasting lines.', '2014-08-18 15:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252640, 1126887, 173844, '<td valign="top">Sleek and elegant but not at all fussy.  And a nicely hooked vanishing point.  Waves of disparate but harmonizing layers roll in towards the viewer, in very subtle procession.Fresh and calm.  I also appreciate the generosity of area allowed the sky and shoulder.</td>', 'Sleek and elegant but not at all fussy.  And a nicely hooked vanishing point.  Waves of disparate but harmonizing layers roll in towards the viewer, in very subtle procession.Fresh and calm.  I also appreciate the generosity of area allowed the sky and shoulder.', '2014-08-18 16:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252644, 1127155, 173844, '<td valign="top">Excellently embodies the spirit of the challenge.  The diminishing arcs of the bridge and the spaces in the guard rail are object lessons.  The textural combination of sea, bridge and sky is a pleasure to look at.  Great choice of black and white.  So very nicely done.</td>', 'Excellently embodies the spirit of the challenge.  The diminishing arcs of the bridge and the spaces in the guard rail are object lessons.  The textural combination of sea, bridge and sky is a pleasure to look at.  Great choice of black and white.  So very nicely done.', '2014-08-18 16:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252646, 1126993, 173844, '<td valign="top">Skyscrapers can be made to look this way, but this particular one affords visual pleasure on several levels.  The mass of the building reaches a vanishing point, and so does the curious facade.  With the addition of the massive base it looks like an enormous fish.  And it''s enjoyably dizzying.  Furthermore, great title.</td>', 'Skyscrapers can be made to look this way, but this particular one affords visual pleasure on several levels.  The mass of the building reaches a vanishing point, and so does the curious facade.  With the addition of the massive base it looks like an enormous fish.  And it''s enjoyably dizzying.  Furthermore, great title.', '2014-08-18 16:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252648, 1127180, 173844, '<td valign="top">A haunting invitation to another land or dimension, and so it''s appropriate that the implied vanishing point is shrouded in darkness.  The sharpness and detail lend great immediacy.  The parallel rows of trees add additional resonance.  A finely balanced composition.  Impressive.</td>', 'A haunting invitation to another land or dimension, and so it''s appropriate that the implied vanishing point is shrouded in darkness.  The sharpness and detail lend great immediacy.  The parallel rows of trees add additional resonance.  A finely balanced composition.  Impressive.', '2014-08-18 16:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252650, 1127133, 173844, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the several fine railroad tracks entries.  The light show adds a dazzling fullness and emphasis to the strong vanishing point.  The light-burst to the left is also lovely.  The unpeopled station in the night gives the viewer a feeling of private privilege in seeing this marvel.</td>', 'My favorite of the several fine railroad tracks entries.  The light show adds a dazzling fullness and emphasis to the strong vanishing point.  The light-burst to the left is also lovely.  The unpeopled station in the night gives the viewer a feeling of private privilege in seeing this marvel.', '2014-08-18 17:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252651, 1127145, 173844, '<td valign="top">The subtly hinted at vanishing point in the next car is a grace note in this tender portrait of a woman resting either at the end of the day or at its beginning.  In counterpoint to the sense of calm here is, as anyone who''s ridden a subway knows, all the clattering noise and shaking of the train.  A winning, excellent image.</td>', 'The subtly hinted at vanishing point in the next car is a grace note in this tender portrait of a woman resting either at the end of the day or at its beginning.  In counterpoint to the sense of calm here is, as anyone who''s ridden a subway knows, all the clattering noise and shaking of the train.  A winning, excellent image.', '2014-08-18 17:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252652, 1127183, 173844, '<td valign="top">An extravagant and stylized sci-fi image, it''s easy and fun to buy into the rocket illusion.  It also looks like two elephants at the top of an escalator that better hustle to get off before that missile strikes.  Generally, an overwhelming perspective.  And the vanishing point --  among the stars.</td>', 'An extravagant and stylized sci-fi image, it''s easy and fun to buy into the rocket illusion.  It also looks like two elephants at the top of an escalator that better hustle to get off before that missile strikes.  Generally, an overwhelming perspective.  And the vanishing point --  among the stars.', '2014-08-18 17:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252654, 1127066, 173844, '<td valign="top">This curious photo looks like a hand-tinted old post card.  Aside from the tracks and gravel bed that''s detailed and black and white-seeming, the trees and sky have a bleeding water color softness.  I like the creativity and artistic sensibility at work here.</td>', 'This curious photo looks like a hand-tinted old post card.  Aside from the tracks and gravel bed that''s detailed and black and white-seeming, the trees and sky have a bleeding water color softness.  I like the creativity and artistic sensibility at work here.', '2014-08-18 17:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252656, 1127022, 173844, '<td valign="top">The human touch warms up this collage-like study of perspective.  The modest depth of focus works well here.  It''s very pleasant to look at.  I am curious, though, about that pod or giant hot dog object hanging down from the tree.  Is it part of the networking?</td>', 'The human touch warms up this collage-like study of perspective.  The modest depth of focus works well here.  It''s very pleasant to look at.  I am curious, though, about that pod or giant hot dog object hanging down from the tree.  Is it part of the networking?', '2014-08-18 17:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252659, 1127021, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice grungy, industrial four-way vanishing point image.  The overgrown tracks are poignant with disuse, a time forgotten.  The tree-of-heaven to the left is a mark of authenticity.<br/>The toxic, yellowish tone makes me uneasy, but perhaps that''s intentional and pertinent.  Same for the granulated sky.</td>', 'Nice grungy, industrial four-way vanishing point image.  The overgrown tracks are poignant with disuse, a time forgotten.  The tree-of-heaven to the left is a mark of authenticity.The toxic, yellowish tone makes me uneasy, but perhaps that''s intentional and pertinent.  Same for the granulated sky.', '2014-08-18 17:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252661, 1127119, 173844, '<td valign="top">Elegant, atmospheric, European-looking scene, quite cinematic, as in "The Third Man."  The vanishing point will be attained eventually, but here it''s creatively helped along by the wall on the right truncating the staircase.  A shimmering delight.</td>', 'Elegant, atmospheric, European-looking scene, quite cinematic, as in "The Third Man."  The vanishing point will be attained eventually, but here it''s creatively helped along by the wall on the right truncating the staircase.  A shimmering delight.', '2014-08-18 17:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252662, 1127145, 19825, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic. I love the depth of the reflection(s). Nicely done.</td>', 'This is fantastic. I love the depth of the reflection(s). Nicely done.', '2014-08-18 17:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252663, 1127126, 19825, '<td valign="top">Excellent image. Simple and elegant.</td>', 'Excellent image. Simple and elegant.', '2014-08-18 17:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252664, 1126887, 19825, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully composed.</td>', 'Wonderfully composed.', '2014-08-18 17:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252665, 1127021, 19825, '<td valign="top">This challenge included lots of images of railroad tracks, but this is my favorite. Well composed and processed.</td>', 'This challenge included lots of images of railroad tracks, but this is my favorite. Well composed and processed.', '2014-08-18 17:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252667, 1126993, 19825, '<td valign="top">Dizzying pattern into the sky. I like it.</td>', 'Dizzying pattern into the sky. I like it.', '2014-08-18 18:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252668, 1126864, 19825, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of the more entertaining Vanishing Point entries.</td>', 'Definitely one of the more entertaining Vanishing Point entries.', '2014-08-18 18:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252669, 1127133, 19825, '<td valign="top">Nice mix of detail and energy.</td>', 'Nice mix of detail and energy.', '2014-08-18 18:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252670, 1126905, 19825, '<td valign="top">And now for something completely different. Thanks for the new perspective on the challenge theme.</td>', 'And now for something completely different. Thanks for the new perspective on the challenge theme.', '2014-08-18 18:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252672, 1127159, 19825, '<td valign="top">I do like this nicely composed urban scene. Others with OCD may be bothered by the slight leaning to the right.</td>', 'I do like this nicely composed urban scene. Others with OCD may be bothered by the slight leaning to the right.', '2014-08-18 18:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252673, 1127150, 19825, '<td valign="top">Nicely layered landscape.</td>', 'Nicely layered landscape.', '2014-08-18 18:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252675, 1127131, 58634, '<td valign="top">I enjoy your post-processing here.</td>', 'I enjoy your post-processing here.', '2014-08-18 18:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252676, 1127033, 19825, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I love the gradient of grays from the lighter foreground to the darker mountaintop and the contrast of textures between the grassland and sky.</td>', 'Very nice. I love the gradient of grays from the lighter foreground to the darker mountaintop and the contrast of textures between the grassland and sky.', '2014-08-18 18:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252677, 1127022, 19825, '<td valign="top">Well spotted and composed.</td>', 'Well spotted and composed.', '2014-08-18 18:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252688, 1127159, 43111, '<td valign="top">//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=1127159#</td>', '//www.dpchallenge.com/challenge_vote_image.php?IMAGE_ID=1127159#', '2014-08-18 19:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252692, 1127206, 173844, '<td valign="top">Pretty spokes of flowers radiating from the treeline.  The flowers in the center and on the right, especially, are like those seen in a impressionistic painting.  Happy image.</td>', 'Pretty spokes of flowers radiating from the treeline.  The flowers in the center and on the right, especially, are like those seen in a impressionistic painting.  Happy image.', '2014-08-18 19:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252729, 1126909, 173844, '<td valign="top">Sci-fi feel, if you ignore what''s going on outside the windows.  I like the overall blue tone and the multiple recessions to a central vanishing point.  The central blue structure is also graphic and abstract.</td>', 'Sci-fi feel, if you ignore what''s going on outside the windows.  I like the overall blue tone and the multiple recessions to a central vanishing point.  The central blue structure is also graphic and abstract.', '2014-08-18 23:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252730, 1126810, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice scenery threaded by a stream that coyly vanishes and reappears with numerous modest vanishing points created by the viewing angle.  It''s an interesting take on the challenge, with substantial depth and far-flung rhythm.</td>', 'Nice scenery threaded by a stream that coyly vanishes and reappears with numerous modest vanishing points created by the viewing angle.  It''s an interesting take on the challenge, with substantial depth and far-flung rhythm.', '2014-08-18 23:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252731, 1127193, 173844, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective image with wood planking that wraps around from fence to pathway, giving subtle volume to the effect.  I especially like the vegetation behind the fence that''s in the style of Chinese brushwork.</td>', 'Simple but effective image with wood planking that wraps around from fence to pathway, giving subtle volume to the effect.  I especially like the vegetation behind the fence that''s in the style of Chinese brushwork.', '2014-08-18 23:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252732, 1126959, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like this flagpole of mystery standing proud as a turret.  The marbled effect of the cloud bokeh and the entire out of focus feel works surprisingly well.  The attention paid to the rope on the cleat is also quite winning.</td>', 'I like this flagpole of mystery standing proud as a turret.  The marbled effect of the cloud bokeh and the entire out of focus feel works surprisingly well.  The attention paid to the rope on the cleat is also quite winning.', '2014-08-18 23:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252735, 1127125, 173844, '<td valign="top">This vividly colored, almost luridly so, scene looks like a page from a Chamber of Commerce booklet.  That''s not saying I don''t like it.  It''s verve and ebullience carry the day.</td>', 'This vividly colored, almost luridly so, scene looks like a page from a Chamber of Commerce booklet.  That''s not saying I don''t like it.  It''s verve and ebullience carry the day.', '2014-08-18 23:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252738, 1127132, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very elegant serpentine road to a distinct vanishing point.  There are great curved and straighter lines in this image.  The walker is nicely placed.  The trees and their interlaced branches make a beautiful frame.<br/>My only subjective quibble is that I''d like to see a darker overall tone.</td>', 'Very elegant serpentine road to a distinct vanishing point.  There are great curved and straighter lines in this image.  The walker is nicely placed.  The trees and their interlaced branches make a beautiful frame.My only subjective quibble is that I''d like to see a darker overall tone.', '2014-08-18 23:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252740, 1126581, 173844, '<td valign="top">Good vanishing point under the overpass.  What I really like here is the palpable sense of summer heaviness in the atmosphere.  And the tacit invitation to travel into those mountains along the tracks.</td>', 'Good vanishing point under the overpass.  What I really like here is the palpable sense of summer heaviness in the atmosphere.  And the tacit invitation to travel into those mountains along the tracks.', '2014-08-19 00:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252741, 1127113, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice groomed, formal feel to this elegant little scene.  It''s no nonsense and forceful, and therefor a strong showing.  I like that patch of sky that opens the whole image up.</td>', 'Nice groomed, formal feel to this elegant little scene.  It''s no nonsense and forceful, and therefor a strong showing.  I like that patch of sky that opens the whole image up.', '2014-08-19 00:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252743, 1127142, 173844, '<td valign="top">Here''s a case where the tilt brings strength and interest to a picture.  Yes there''s a certain giddiness to it, but it grabs my attention as it whips around to that farther stretch of bridge beyond the first arch.  Well executed.</td>', 'Here''s a case where the tilt brings strength and interest to a picture.  Yes there''s a certain giddiness to it, but it grabs my attention as it whips around to that farther stretch of bridge beyond the first arch.  Well executed.', '2014-08-19 00:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252745, 1127200, 173844, '<td valign="top">Rather busy -- well, it is Manhattan -- but the recession of the bikes, which are facing the viewer from the side, and their stands is an unusual take on a vanishing point. The buildings lining the street in the distance also participate in the recession.</td>', 'Rather busy -- well, it is Manhattan -- but the recession of the bikes, which are facing the viewer from the side, and their stands is an unusual take on a vanishing point. The buildings lining the street in the distance also participate in the recession.', '2014-08-19 00:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252747, 1126923, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture with the parallel crepuscular rays seeming to vanish towards the horizon.  The blurred water gives the image a wonderful ethereal feeling.</td>', 'Beautiful picture with the parallel crepuscular rays seeming to vanish towards the horizon.  The blurred water gives the image a wonderful ethereal feeling.', '2014-08-19 00:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252750, 1127149, 173844, '<td valign="top">Vanishing points are especially spectacular in hyperspace.  The lighted buildings also head toward the Freedom Tower, which supplies its own faceted vanishing points.</td>', 'Vanishing points are especially spectacular in hyperspace.  The lighted buildings also head toward the Freedom Tower, which supplies its own faceted vanishing points.', '2014-08-19 00:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252751, 1127112, 173844, '<td valign="top">Original take wherein the painted white arrow points to the darkness as a place of vanishing. The barely visible dashed lines offer paths to take in the unknown.  A thoughtful image.<br/>At least that''s how I see it.</td>', 'Original take wherein the painted white arrow points to the darkness as a place of vanishing. The barely visible dashed lines offer paths to take in the unknown.  A thoughtful image.At least that''s how I see it.', '2014-08-19 00:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252755, 1127020, 173844, '<td valign="top">A casual-seeming image that is still appealing.</td>', 'A casual-seeming image that is still appealing.', '2014-08-19 00:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252768, 1127119, 124815, '<td valign="top">A classic<br/>Beautiful<br/>Bump</td>', 'A classicBeautifulBump', '2014-08-19 01:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252789, 1127186, 8759, '<td valign="top">for me it doesn''t make it with the arch cut out. good try though</td>', 'for me it doesn''t make it with the arch cut out. good try though', '2014-08-19 05:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7252791, 1127112, 8759, '<td valign="top">intriguing. nice find</td>', 'intriguing. nice find', '2014-08-19 05:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
