(7252799, 1127159, 8759, '<td valign="top">i bet this is not going well. <br/> <br/>while the point is there and thus meet the challenge description, for me the tilt on the horizon takes at least 2 points on the voting scale. a bit of post processing always help (unless you have any particular reason or point of view)<br/> <br/> <br/> good luck and keep entering the challenges.</td>', 'i bet this is not going well.  while the point is there and thus meet the challenge description, for me the tilt on the horizon takes at least 2 points on the voting scale. a bit of post processing always help (unless you have any particular reason or point of view)   good luck and keep entering the challenges.', '2014-08-19 05:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
