(7252984, 1126923, 86218, '<td valign="top">Welcome back Philip. 3 years and back with a bang. Lovely image and finisihing to go with it. Hope to see more of your work. Congrats.</td>', 'Welcome back Philip. 3 years and back with a bang. Lovely image and finisihing to go with it. Hope to see more of your work. Congrats.', '2014-08-20 01:13:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7252985, 1127125, 1031, '<td valign="top">I was curious how you shot this, since I couldn''t find any distinctive shadows indicating that the sun was in the "correct" direction, and the small patch of blue suggested the possibility of a substantially clear sky above. I take it from your notes that it was somewhat more overcast than it looks?<br/> <br/>Otherwise, I agree with Don -- it looks unreal, and got one of my highest votes. :-)</td>', 'I was curious how you shot this, since I couldn''t find any distinctive shadows indicating that the sun was in the "correct" direction, and the small patch of blue suggested the possibility of a substantially clear sky above. I take it from your notes that it was somewhat more overcast than it looks? Otherwise, I agree with Don -- it looks unreal, and got one of my highest votes. :-)', '2014-08-20 01:13:14.000000', NULL, 0),
