(7253381, 1127060, 30490, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments, it helps me to understand what worked and what didn''t in the photo.  To answer the questions, there was nothing cropped out of the photo, this is just how I took it.  I agree the tilted horizon is distracting, I played with it before submission, but wasn''t happy with the results.  I need to improve my photo shop skills if I am going to continue to enter challenges.  :-)<br/></td>', 'Thanks for the comments, it helps me to understand what worked and what didn''t in the photo.  To answer the questions, there was nothing cropped out of the photo, this is just how I took it.  I agree the tilted horizon is distracting, I played with it before submission, but wasn''t happy with the results.  I need to improve my photo shop skills if I am going to continue to enter challenges.  :-)', '2014-08-21 01:14:24.000000', NULL, 0),
